Z||000006||pherder||02-01-2000||08:39 PM||||Batboy,<P>Click on the photo that you want to copy and keep clicking until you end up with JUST the picture in your browser's window.<P>In IE5, I then just right clicked on the picture and did a "save picture as ..."<P>I believe Netscape is the same way except it states something different like (?) "save target"  (?)<P>If that doesn't work for you I can send you a picture or two.  BTW, they are SO BAD (i.e. low resolution) why would you want to put them on your site with so many great pictures of Fieros ?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Paul<BR><p>[This message has been edited by pherder (edited 02-01-2000).]||||reg||3
